@startuml

autolink

actor Student
participant "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "API (Next.js route handler / server action)" as API
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "Supabase Postgres (RLS)" as DB

== Submission Flow ==

UI -> Auth: getSession/getUser
alt Unauthenticated user
  Auth --> UI: no session
  UI --> Student: Prompt login
else Authenticated user
  Auth --> UI: session + user
  UI -> API: GET assignment details
  API -> DB: SELECT assignment by id
  alt RLS denial / permission error
    DB --> API: error (RLS denied)
    API --> UI: error response
    UI --> Student: Show access error
  else Success
    DB --> API: assignment data
    API --> UI: assignment details
    UI --> Student: Render assignment

    Student -> UI: Submit code snippet
    UI -> API: POST submission (code, assignment_id)
    API -> DB: INSERT submission
    alt Submission deadline passed
      DB --> API: error (deadline constraint)
      API --> UI: error response
      UI --> Student: Show deadline error
    else RLS denial / permission error
      DB --> API: error (RLS denied)
      API --> UI: error response
      UI --> Student: Show permission error
    else Success
      DB --> API: submission created
      API --> UI: success response
      UI --> Student: Success + navigate to submission detail/history
    end
  end
end

== Later: Peer Review Cycle ==

API -> DB: Assign reviewers (manual trigger or scheduled job)
DB --> API: review assignments created

Student -> UI: Reviewer fetches assigned reviews
UI -> API: GET assigned reviews
API -> DB: SELECT review_assignments
DB --> API: assigned reviews
API --> UI: assigned reviews list

Student -> UI: Submit review (rubric + comments)
UI -> API: POST review
API -> DB: INSERT review
alt RLS denial / permission error
  DB --> API: error (RLS denied)
  API --> UI: error response
  UI --> Student: Show permission error
else Success
  DB --> API: review created
  API --> UI: success response
  UI --> Student: Review submitted confirmation
end

Student -> UI: Author fetches received feedback
UI -> API: GET received reviews
API -> DB: SELECT reviews for author
DB --> API: review feedback
API --> UI: feedback data
UI --> Student: Display peer feedback

@enduml
